==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Crash Fever'''}} & The Battle Cats team up for a thrilling collab event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On between April 14th and 27th, 2017!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Crash Fever Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Only for a short time, Crash Fever collab capsules are available in The Battle Cats!<br>
[[Mobius (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''MOBIUS (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive damage to Red enemies, with 100% knockback!<br>
[[Belial (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''BELIAL (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Gets much stronger as he takes damage!

<small><small>※ Both the Crash Fever limited edition units and normal Rare Capsule units may be received from draws at the Collab Capsules, but Crash Fever units cannot be received from any other Rare Capsule set. Tap the Capsule Set select icons at the top of the Rare Capsule screen to select Crash Fever if you want to get a limited edition unit!<br>
※ The First-Time Discount does not apply to Crash Fever collab capsules.<br>
※ If Crash Fever capsule set content does not appear, make sure that you have a strong network connection are updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Crash Fever Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Take the plunge into a vibrant virtual kingdom!<br>
The stars of Crash Fever appear as enemies determined to defeat the Cat Army!<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend / Event Stages to select the limited edition collab map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Gates of ALICE!'''}}<br>
Three days after ({{Color|#FF00CC|'''April 17 (15:00~)'''}}), the next collab map, {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Moonlit City'''}}, will also appear!<br>
Clear any stage on either of these maps to receive Timed Score rewards, and {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food'''}} when you clear all stages on a map.<br>
These stages are only available for a short time, so don't miss out on your chance to take on these special challenges!

<small><small>※ If Crash Fever special event stages do not appear, make sure that you have a strong network connection are updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Play Crash Fever to unlock a special Battle Cats unit!'''}}<br>
During this event, clear the Battle Cats collab stages in the Crash Fever app to receive awesome rewards!<br>
・Clear "Battle Cats Attack!" to receive the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Special Cat "'''}}[[Happy 100 (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Happy 100'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00CC|'''"!'''}}<br>
・Clear "Bahamut Cat Invasion" to receive {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30,000XP!'''}}<br>
・Clear "The Crazed Cat" to receive {{Color|#FF00CC|'''3 Cat Tickets!'''}}<br>
Acheive victory in all stages to earn all these special rewards!

<small><small>※How to Collect the Collab Rewards<br>
Once you have cleared the collab stages in Crash Fever, visit the main menu of Crash Fever, then visit Missions and select the Battle Cats special mission. Accept the rewards when the popup appears, then once you boot up the Battle Cats app your items will be delivered to your account.<br>
※ Activate Happy by visiting the Upgrade menu and locating her at the Rare Cats section. You will then be able to Equip her to the battle formation of your choice.<br>
※ If Crash Fever rewards do not appear, make sure that you have a strong network connection are updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.</small></small>

Check out the official Crash Fever site below!<br>
https://www.facebook.com/CrashFeverEN/

